@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Get System Status and Configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Get Live MJPEG Annotated Video Feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/video
Accept: multipart/x-mixed-replace

###

### 3. Simulating .NET Dashboard Endpoint (Receiving Alerts from Python Pipeline)
# Default target: http://localhost:5000/api/alerts
POST http://localhost:5000/api/alerts
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="track_id"

888
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="confidence"

0.8742
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="timestamp"

2026-05-26T17:15:00.000000
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="alert_track_888_20260526_171500.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

./alerts/alert_track_888_20260526_171500.jpg
